          <p>Lightweight chat-native workflows engineered for artisans, households, and municipal employment programs operating across low-bandwidth regions.</p>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="rd-arrow-btn">See how it works<span class="rd-arrow-btn-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Fragment set:html={ic.arrow} /></span></a>
